        "Chats": [
            {
                "Title": "Launch War Room",
                "Members": [
                    "Serena Ribeiro",
                    "Charlotte Waltson",
                    "Babak Shammas",
                    "David Power"
                ],
                "Messages": [
                    {
                        "Offset": -37,
                        "Time": "08:12:00",
                        "Sender": "Serena Ribeiro",
                        "Message": "Morning all — using this chat as our running war room for ProductABC launch coordination. Ping here for anything time-sensitive."
                    },
                    {
                        "Offset": -37,
                        "Time": "08:14:00",
                        "Sender": "Charlotte Waltson",
                        "Message": "Sounds good. I'll post supplier updates here as they come in."
                    },
                    {
                        "Offset": -30,
                        "Time": "14:31:00",
                        "Sender": "Babak Shammas",
                        "Message": "Heads up — agency accepted our revised labeling language this morning. Formal confirmation to follow."
                    },
                    {
                        "Offset": -30,
                        "Time": "14:33:00",
                        "Sender": "Serena Ribeiro",
                        "Message": "That's fantastic news, Marcus! Huge unblock for us."
                    },
                    {
                        "Offset": -30,
                        "Time": "14:34:00",
                        "Sender": "Babak Shammas",
                        "Message": "Great timing, I was just about to finalize the pricing package."
                    },
                    {
                        "Offset": -21,
                        "Time": "11:02:00",
                        "Sender": "Charlotte Waltson",
                        "Message": "Secondary site validation batch passed. We're fully qualified on both manufacturing sources now."
                    },
                    {
                        "Offset": -21,
                        "Time": "11:05:00",
                        "Sender": "Serena Ribeiro",
                        "Message": "Excellent. That closes out our last major open risk item ahead of the executive checkpoint."
                    },
                    {
                        "Offset": -21,
                        "Time": "11:06:00",
                        "Sender": "David Power",
                        "Message": "Field team is going to be thrilled to hear supply is secured. Momentum with accounts has been building."
                    },
                    {
                        "Offset": -16,
                        "Time": "09:15:00",
                        "Sender": "Babak Shammas",
                        "Message": "Pricing and forecast package is finalized and ready for the executive checkpoint deck."
                    },
                    {
                        "Offset": -16,
                        "Time": "09:20:00",
                        "Sender": "Serena Ribeiro",
                        "Message": "Perfect, I'll pull everything together this week."
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "Title": "Marketing & Product Alignment",
                "Members": [
                    "Serena Ribeiro",
                    "David Power",
                    "Babak Shammas"
                ],
                "Messages": [
                    {
                        "Offset": -35,
                        "Time": "10:00:00",
                        "Sender": "Serena Ribeiro",
                        "Message": "Starting this thread to keep marketing and sales aligned on ProductABC messaging as things evolve."
                    },
                    {
                        "Offset": -35,
                        "Time": "10:02:00",
                        "Sender": "David Power",
                        "Message": "Appreciate it — the field is eager for updated collateral once labeling settles."
                    },
                    {
                        "Offset": -26,
                        "Time": "16:10:00",
                        "Sender": "Babak Shammas",
                        "Message": "Circulated the pricing options doc for your review — parity vs. modest premium over Product 358."
                    },
                    {
                        "Offset": -26,
                        "Time": "16:22:00",
                        "Sender": "David Power",
                        "Message": "My vote is parity, especially for accounts like Meridian Health Alliance that are price-sensitive on formulary decisions."
                    },
                    {
                        "Offset": -25,
                        "Time": "09:05:00",
                        "Sender": "Serena Ribeiro",
                        "Message": "Agreed, market research supports that too. Babak is finalizing at parity with Product 358."
                    },
                    {
                        "Offset": -19,
                        "Time": "13:30:00",
                        "Sender": "Serena Ribeiro",
                        "Message": "Updated launch collateral is in review now that labeling is final. Should be ready by end of week."
                    },
                    {
                        "Offset": -19,
                        "Time": "13:32:00",
                        "Sender": "David Power",
                        "Message": "Perfect timing — several accounts are asking for updated materials."
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "Title": "Regulatory Team",
                "Members": [
                    "Babak Shammas",
                    "Cassandra Dunn"
                ],
                "Messages": [
                    {
                        "Offset": -37,
                        "Time": "09:00:00",
                        "Sender": "Babak Shammas",
                        "Message": "Cassandra — setting up this chat so we can keep the risk register in sync with regulatory status in real time."
                    },
                    {
                        "Offset": -37,
                        "Time": "09:02:00",
                        "Sender": "Cassandra Dunn",
                        "Message": "Perfect, that'll save us a lot of back and forth."
                    },
                    {
                        "Offset": -32,
                        "Time": "15:45:00",
                        "Sender": "Babak Shammas",
                        "Message": "FDA pushed back on our dosing claim language. Submitting revised copy today."
                    },
                    {
                        "Offset": -32,
                        "Time": "15:47:00",
                        "Sender": "Cassandra Dunn",
                        "Message": "Logging that as a high-priority item on the risk register now, with you as owner."
                    },
                    {
                        "Offset": -31,
                        "Time": "10:20:00",
                        "Sender": "Babak Shammas",
                        "Message": "Estimate two to three weeks for a response. Will keep you posted."
                    },
                    {
                        "Offset": -30,
                        "Time": "13:15:00",
                        "Sender": "Babak Shammas",
                        "Message": "Update: agency accepted the revised language. We're finalizing the package insert now."
                    },
                    {
                        "Offset": -30,
                        "Time": "13:17:00",
                        "Sender": "Cassandra Dunn",
                        "Message": "Great — closing out that risk register item today."
                    },
                    {
                        "Offset": -20,
                        "Time": "08:40:00",
                        "Sender": "Babak Shammas",
                        "Message": "Approved package insert is final and incorporated into all commercial materials."
                    },
                    {
                        "Offset": -20,
                        "Time": "08:42:00",
                        "Sender": "Cassandra Dunn",
                        "Message": "Noted for the steering committee update. Nice work getting this across the line."
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "Title": "Executive Launch Coordination",
                "Members": [
                    "Charlotte Waltson",
                    "Serena Ribeiro"
                ],
                "Messages": [
                    {
                        "Offset": -36,
                        "Time": "07:45:00",
                        "Sender": "Charlotte Waltson",
                        "Message": "Serena, appreciate the steady updates. Let me know if anything needs my attention before the checkpoint."
                    },
                    {
                        "Offset": -36,
                        "Time": "07:50:00",
                        "Sender": "Serena Ribeiro",
                        "Message": "Will do. Right now the two big items are regulatory labeling and secondary site qualification — both tracking to close within a few weeks."
                    },
                    {
                        "Offset": -20,
                        "Time": "08:50:00",
                        "Sender": "Serena Ribeiro",
                        "Message": "Both of those items are now resolved. We're in strong shape heading into the checkpoint."
                    },
                    {
                        "Offset": -20,
                        "Time": "08:55:00",
                        "Sender": "Charlotte Waltson",
                        "Message": "Excellent. Please make sure Finance and Compliance have their materials ready as well."
                    },
                    {
                        "Offset": -18,
                        "Time": "17:10:00",
                        "Sender": "Charlotte Waltson",
                        "Message": "David raised the idea of pulling the launch date forward — what's your read?"
                    },
                    {
                        "Offset": -18,
                        "Time": "17:20:00",
                        "Sender": "Serena Ribeiro",
                        "Message": "I'd rather hold the current date to protect field training and payer outreach timing. Flagged the same to David."
                    },
                    {
                        "Offset": -18,
                        "Time": "17:22:00",
                        "Sender": "Charlotte Waltson",
                        "Message": "Agreed, let's keep the current date. We can revisit if field readiness clearly allows it."
                    },
                    {
                        "Offset": -14,
                        "Time": "09:00:00",
                        "Sender": "Serena Ribeiro",
                        "Message": "Final readiness materials are ready for tomorrow's executive checkpoint."
                    },
                    {
                        "Offset": -14,
                        "Time": "09:05:00",
                        "Sender": "Charlotte Waltson",
                        "Message": "Looking forward to it. Great work getting us here."
                    }
                ]
            }
        ],
